  <Annotation x='3624' y='696' size='6' anchor='262'>IDOIMPRESION.IMTC_DNIS_IMPRESION</Annotation>
  <Annotation x='3732' y='720' size='6' anchor='264'>IN_DEVO_REPR = &quot;1&quot; || IN_DEVO_REPR = &quot;2&quot;</Annotation>
  <Annotation x='3828' y='780' size='14' bold='1' anchor='266'>Se calcula la variable  V_CIN_ORI_IMPR por medio
